---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="fade-in flex min-h-dvh flex-col items-center justify-center px-6">
    <h1
      class="tracking-tight text-balance text-fg [text-shadow:0_0_40px_rgb(92_225_255/0.25)]"
    >
      Hello! <br />
      As the name of this website suggests, I am Thomas, and I am not a web dev. <br />
      I am primarily a modern C++ developer, although I do use several other languages on a regular basis as well. <br />
      As of October 2026 I have just started work on this website in my free time to showcase some of my favorite things I've done. <br />
      In the future you will find some (hopefully interesting) essays here about projects and programming techniques I like. <br />
      Thanks for your patience while I work on this.
    </h1>
  </main>
</Layout>
